| 0x1151FFFF | 0x11FFFFFF | Reserved | &#10060; |
| 0x12000000 | 0x12000FFF | Timer0/Timer1 register | &#9989; TIMER0, TIMER1 (reused common block) |
| 0x12001000 | 0x12001FFF | Timer2/Timer3 register | &#9989; TIMER2, TIMER3 (reused common block) |
| 0x12002000 | 0x12002FFF | Timer4/Timer5 register | &#9989; TIMER4, TIMER5 (reused common block) |
