| 0x12020000 | 0x1202FFFF | System control register | &#9989; SYS_CTRL (generated from the data sheet) |
| 0x12030000 | 0x1203FFFF | MISC register | &#9989; MISC_CTRL (generated from the data sheet) |
| 0x12040000 | 0x1204FFFF | SYSCNT register | &#10060; |
| 0x12050000 | 0x12050FFF | WDG0 register | &#9989; WDG0 (reused common block) |
| 0x12051000 | 0x12051FFF | WDG1 register | &#9989; WDG1 (reused common block) |
| 0x12060000 | 0x1206FFFF | DDRC register | &#9989; DDRC_AXI, DDRC_TZASC, DDRC_QOSB, DDRC_DMC, DDRC_PHY (generated from the data sheet) |
| 0x12070000 | 0x1207FFFF | PWM register | &#9989; PWM (reused common block) |
| 0x12080000 | 0x1208FFFF | RTC register | &#9989; RTC (reused common block) |
| 0x12090000 | 0x1209FFFF | PMC register | &#9989; PMC (generated from the data sheet) |
| 0x120A0000 | 0x120A0FFF | UART0 register | &#9989; UART0 (reused common block) |
| 0x120A1000 | 0x120A1FFF | UART1 register | &#9989; UART1 (reused common block) |
| 0x120A2000 | 0x120A2FFF | UART2 register | &#9989; UART2 (reused common block) |
| 0x120A3000 | 0x120A3FFF | UART3 register | &#9989; UART3 (reused common block) |
| 0x120A4000 | 0x120A4FFF | UART4 register | &#9989; UART4 (reused common block) |
| 0x120B0000 | 0x120B0FFF | I2C0 register | &#9989; I2C0 (reused common block) |
| 0x120B1000 | 0x120B1FFF | I2C1 register | &#9989; I2C1 (reused common block) |
| 0x120B2000 | 0x120B2FFF | I2C2 register | &#9989; I2C2 (reused common block) |
