| 0x120C2000 | 0x120C2FFF | SPI2 register | &#9989; SPI2 (reused common block) |
| 0x120C3000 | 0x120C3FFF | 3-wire SPI register | &#9989; SPI_3WIRE (reused common block) |
| 0x120D0000 | 0x120D0FFF | GPIO0 register | &#9989; GPIO0 (reused common block) |
| 0x120D1000 | 0x120D1FFF | GPIO1 register | &#9989; GPIO1 (reused common block) |
| 0x120D2000 | 0x120D2FFF | GPIO2 register | &#9989; GPIO2 (reused common block) |
